{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>[And they shall spring up among the grass].</b> וצמחו is vocalized with a shuruk, like חציר. Many said it refers to offspring, and so it is: they shall spring up as though they sit among the grass, and the meaning is that they shall flourish and multiply."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 44, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:57:51.672835698Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}